### 3. Example Usage

```bash
bdapi call <TAB>
```

Will expand to:

```
/projects
/projects/{projectId}
/projects/{projectId}/versions
/projects/{projectId}/versions/{projectVersionId}/components
```

This works because the completion script reads **directly from the Postman collection**, ensuring it always stays in sync with supported APIs.

